=== meta ===
bypass: 112
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
issue: 216
title: deleting the workflow whose suite is `node --test`
origin: issue #216, the deletion rule. Whether a deleted workflow ran a suite was row 69's token scan alone, which finds no runner in `node --test`, so deleting the only test workflow passed at warn while disabling its step blocks. v0.6.0 passes it
=== before: .github/workflows/ci.yml ===
name: ci
on:
  pull_request:
jobs:
  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4
        with:
          node-version: 22
      - run: npm ci
      - run: node --test
